WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,970
We can abandon the wall tomorrow and call it a day.

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:06,330
Okay, everyone, take a breath and drink a bowl of water.

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:17,770
Xiao Xi, wait until the house is built

4
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:20,370
I asked Captain Wang to make coal and propose marriage to your house.

5
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:27,330
Eat something good today, bear meat is a great supplement

6
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,650
Shen Zi, drink more soup

7
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,580
Brother Qin, let me stew

8
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:36,150
Eat some fruit first

9
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,350
Intestinal benefits

10
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:43,830
Shen Zi, this soup is stewed with medicinal spring water.

11
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:44,870
good for health

12
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:47,510
I also left some for you to take back and eat slowly.

13
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:52,310
This soup is so delicious

14
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:57,790
Brother Qin, how old was the bear you beat?

15
00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:00,510
He weighs six to seven hundred pounds and is taller than me when he stands.
